  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till punktinsatser inom energisektorn (statliga elbolaget, till energiministeriet, Rural energy agency och elregulatorn) f&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llbar utveckling av energisektorn i Tanzania, fr&#xE4;mst f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng till elektricitet i rurala och peri-urbana Tanzania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA to the energy sector (state owned utility TANESCO, Ministry of Energy and Minerals, Rural Energy Agency, the regulator EWURA) for a sustainable development of the energy sector in Tanzania, to facilitate increased access to modern energy services in rural and peri-urban Tanzania.</narrative>
